WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:04.810
<i>The tournament finals have finally begun.</i>

00:04.810 --> 00:10.150
<i>Nankatsu SC played against Naniwa FC, the representatives of Osaka.</i>

00:10.150 --> 00:13.440
<i>Nakanishi's overwhelming defensive power was on full display,</i>

00:13.440 --> 00:16.450
<i>but Nankatsu SC continued to boldly attack the goal.</i>

00:17.530 --> 00:22.040
<i>Tsubasa fired away, and after finally scoring for the first time,</i>

00:22.040 --> 00:26.120
<i>he used that momentum to pile on the score against Naniwa.</i>

00:26.120 --> 00:30.840
I'm gonna take that golden right leg of yours!

00:37.250 --> 00:40.180
<i>Meanwhile, it's been revealed that Musashi FC's Misugi</i>

00:40.180 --> 00:43.520
<i>is suffering from a heart disease.</i>

00:43.520 --> 00:46.770
<i>As every team's expectations become entangled,</i>

00:46.770 --> 00:51.900
<i>Meiwa FC, under Kojiro's lead, have called their secret weapon into action.</i>

00:53.570 --> 00:57.570
<i>The National Youth Football Tournament is about come to its end.</i>

00:57.570 --> 01:00.510
<i>Only four teams remain in the finals tournament,</i>

01:00.510 --> 01:02.830
<i>with only the semi-finals and finals remaining.</i>

01:02.830 --> 01:03.910
SIGN: FURANO ELEMENTARY - GOOD LUCK

01:07.790 --> 01:09.810
<i>In today's semi-finals, the first match will be between</i>

01:09.810 --> 01:13.800
<i>Furano Elementary, from North Hokkaido, and Meiwa FC, from Saitama.</i>

01:13.800 --> 01:20.140
<i>In the second match, Shizuoka's Nankatsu SC will face Tokyo's Musashi FC.</i>

01:20.140 --> 01:24.260
Meiwa and Furano... Whoever wins, it will be hard for us.

01:24.260 --> 01:25.140
You're right.

01:34.640 --> 01:36.980
<i>Only two games remain until I become the champion.</i>

01:38.780 --> 01:40.450
<i>I'll definitely win!</i>

01:58.070 --> 02:03.700
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

01:58.120 --> 02:03.750
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

02:03.700 --> 02:08.710
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

02:03.750 --> 02:08.710
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

02:09.380 --> 02:14.550
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

02:09.380 --> 02:14.590
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:15.260 --> 02:22.880
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:15.260 --> 02:22.880
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:22.880 --> 02:28.650
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:22.880 --> 02:28.690
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:28.650 --> 02:37.150
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:28.690 --> 02:37.150
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:37.150 --> 02:42.940
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:37.150 --> 02:42.940
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:42.940 --> 02:48.870
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:42.940 --> 02:48.870
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:48.870 --> 02:50.380
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:50.380 --> 02:57.670
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:50.380 --> 02:57.670
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

02:57.670 --> 03:00.590
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

02:57.670 --> 03:00.590
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

03:00.590 --> 03:05.520
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

03:00.590 --> 03:05.520
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:16.290 --> 03:20.630
<b><b>EPISODE 19:
FIERCE FIGHT! MEIWA VS. FURANO</b></b>

03:17.630 --> 03:19.920
<i>Both teams have taken their positions.</i>

03:19.920 --> 03:22.090
<i>Which of them will advance to the finals?</i>

03:22.090 --> 03:27.680
<i>Will it be Meiwa, led by Hyuga? Or will it be Furano, who value team play with Matsuyama as their pillar?</i>

03:27.680 --> 03:31.890
<i>Kojiro Hyuga... I'm going to get even with you for what you did at the cafeteria.</i>

03:32.480 --> 03:34.520
<i>To hell with your so-called "team play"!</i>

03:34.520 --> 03:38.520
<i>I'll smash that weak ideology into pieces!</i>

03:39.380 --> 03:43.780
<i>The first match of the semi-finals begins with Meiwa's kick-off!</i>

03:43.780 --> 03:45.280
And here we go!

03:45.280 --> 03:48.530
<i>Sawada, working hard at being the team's pillar despite being a 4th grader,</i>

03:48.530 --> 03:51.670
<i>drives into their opponent's field with the ball.</i>

03:51.670 --> 03:53.290
All right! Let's do this again!

03:53.290 --> 03:55.690
Don't underestimate him just because he's a 4th grader.

03:55.690 --> 03:57.400
Pay special attention to him!

03:57.400 --> 03:58.040
Understood!

03:59.670 --> 04:00.670
Hyuga!

04:01.550 --> 04:02.800
<i>Nice pass!</i>

04:02.800 --> 04:06.300
<i>Meiwa swiftly gets the ball to Kojiro Hyuga.</i>

04:06.300 --> 04:08.260
<i>Good. Let's get that first goal.</i>

04:08.260 --> 04:10.680
<i>Hyuga pushes forward!</i>

04:10.680 --> 04:12.160
Leave him to me!

04:12.160 --> 04:15.730
<i>Furano's captain Hikaru Matsuyama is covering Hyuga.</i>

04:15.730 --> 04:18.060
I'll be thoroughly marking you today.

04:18.060 --> 04:20.650
I hope you're ready for this, Hyuga!

04:20.650 --> 04:22.740
Stop me if you can!

04:22.740 --> 04:24.690
<i>Already, a pivotal moment emerges!</i>

04:24.690 --> 04:26.790
<i>A one-to-one fight between the two aces!</i>

04:26.790 --> 04:28.340
<i>As expected of Matsuyama!</i>

04:28.340 --> 04:30.210
<i>He won't let Hyuga do as he pleases.</i>

04:30.210 --> 04:33.600
<i>Hyuga continues to hang on to and control the ball.</i>

04:33.600 --> 04:35.160
They are matched up well against each other.

04:36.670 --> 04:38.040
<i>Damn it!</i>

04:38.040 --> 04:40.290
<i>This guy... is good.</i>

04:40.290 --> 04:43.570
We can't let this continue! We should support our captain!

04:43.570 --> 04:44.550
Yeah!

04:44.550 --> 04:48.660
<i>Their patience running thin, Furano comes to Matsuyama's rescue!</i>

04:48.660 --> 04:49.550
Captain!

04:50.460 --> 04:51.930
Guys!

04:51.930 --> 04:52.680
Takeshi!

04:53.020 --> 04:53.680
Yes!

04:53.680 --> 04:56.140
<i>Hyuga sends the ball to Sawada for the time being.</i>

04:56.600 --> 04:59.850
<i>Matsuyama quickly cuts the pass!</i>

04:59.850 --> 05:00.560
What?

05:00.560 --> 05:01.440
It's mine!

05:01.440 --> 05:02.190
Damn it!

05:02.190 --> 05:03.440
Kaneda!

05:03.940 --> 05:05.900
<i>Furano mounts a quick counterattack.</i>

05:05.900 --> 05:07.420
You dare underestimate...

05:07.420 --> 05:09.740
Don't expect me to take this lying down!

05:11.970 --> 05:13.240
Watch out, Kaneda!

05:14.540 --> 05:17.330
<i>It's Hyuga's specialty, a fierce sliding tackle!</i>

05:19.400 --> 05:20.630
I'll keep going like this!

05:21.480 --> 05:22.290
Hyuga!

05:22.290 --> 05:23.990
<i>That's Hyuga for you!</i>

05:23.990 --> 05:25.790
<i>His tenacity is amazing!</i>

05:25.790 --> 05:29.300
<i>He went to steal the ball he'd just lost all by himself,</i>

05:29.300 --> 05:31.800
<i>and is now making his way to Furano's goal!</i>

05:33.430 --> 05:35.180
Everyone, fall back! Get back here!

05:35.680 --> 05:40.190
<i>Winning is the only thing on my mind right now.</i>

05:40.190 --> 05:43.320
<i>Hyuga has reached the box in a matter of moments!</i>

05:43.900 --> 05:47.360
<i>I will win! No matter the means, I will win!</i>

05:47.360 --> 05:48.820
<i>I must...</i>

05:48.820 --> 05:51.320
<i>Hyuga gets ready to shoot immediately!</i>

05:51.900 --> 05:55.580
<i>I must win!</i>

05:56.730 --> 05:57.910
<i>It's in!</i>

05:57.910 --> 05:59.830
<i>Meiwa opens the score!</i>

05:59.830 --> 06:01.580
You did it, Hyuga!

06:01.580 --> 06:03.410
<i>He's on fire today as well!</i>

06:03.410 --> 06:06.090
<i>It's the ferocious tiger of Meiwa, Hyuga!</i>

06:06.090 --> 06:08.840
<i>This is his 25th goal in the tournament.</i>

06:08.840 --> 06:13.470
<i>He's now tied Nankatsu's Tsubasa Ozora in the scoring contest.</i>

06:15.600 --> 06:17.520
They just scored on us...

06:17.520 --> 06:19.520
It's okay, guys!

06:19.520 --> 06:23.770
The game has just begun, and Meiwa is nothing without Hyuga.

06:23.770 --> 06:27.400
Let's teach them that football is about team play!

06:27.400 --> 06:28.570
All right!

06:29.470 --> 06:32.160
<i>Furano continues to challenge Meiwa, but—</i>

06:32.160 --> 06:33.410
<i>As if I'd let you through!</i>

06:34.650 --> 06:37.290
<i>Hyuga's sliding tackles are in full force!</i>

06:37.290 --> 06:38.440
Nakagawa!

06:38.440 --> 06:41.040
<i>With Kojiro Hyuga blocking their path,</i>

06:41.040 --> 06:43.380
<i>they have yet to put together any meaningful offense.</i>

06:43.380 --> 06:45.760
As expected, Meiwa is better.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.630
You can't tell yet.

06:48.380 --> 06:51.630
It snows a lot where Furano Elementary is.

06:52.900 --> 06:57.440
Everyone practices hard daily in that deep snow.

06:57.440 --> 06:58.890
<i>Come on, let me hear you!</i>

06:58.890 --> 07:01.430
<i>Don't get discouraged by this much snow.</i>

07:01.430 --> 07:04.110
That's caused them to develop a certain level of persistence and grit.

07:04.110 --> 07:05.190
Captain!

07:05.190 --> 07:07.190
<i>It's a chance for Furano!</i>

07:07.190 --> 07:09.690
<i>The pass reaches Matsuyama, who is right in front of the goal.</i>

07:09.690 --> 07:10.950
<i>He's unmarked!</i>

07:10.950 --> 07:12.500
<i>All right, I'll catch up with them!</i>

07:12.500 --> 07:14.070
<i>Matsuyama gets ready to shoot!</i>

07:14.070 --> 07:15.490
I won't let you!

07:15.490 --> 07:18.330
<i>Hyuga is back to stop him!</i>

07:18.330 --> 07:19.910
<i>There you are, Hyuga.</i>

07:23.240 --> 07:23.850
<i>What?!</i>

07:23.850 --> 07:27.420
<i>He clearly catches his foot instead of the ball!</i>

07:29.480 --> 07:30.630
<i>This is a huge foul!</i>

07:30.630 --> 07:32.580
<i>Furano has won a penalty kick!</i>

07:34.080 --> 07:35.180
Hyuga...

07:36.110 --> 07:39.560
I have defeated your sliding tackle.

07:40.350 --> 07:42.810
You bastard! Did you use your foot on purpose?

07:42.810 --> 07:44.980
<i>Hyuga receives a yellow card.</i>

07:44.980 --> 07:47.060
<i>A second yellow card would result in expulsion.</i>

07:47.060 --> 07:50.820
<i>With this, Hyuga can't just do as he likes, anymore.</i>

07:52.740 --> 07:58.710
<i>Even though he won that penalty kick... will his foot be okay?</i>

07:58.710 --> 08:01.160
There's no way I'd lose to a mere thing such as this.

08:01.570 --> 08:02.900
You're going to learn today, Hyuga.

08:02.900 --> 08:04.900
Football can't be played alone.

08:04.900 --> 08:09.920
We, Furano, will definitely beat your one-man team, Meiwa.

08:16.720 --> 08:19.140
<i>Furano has a chance to equalize the score.</i>

08:19.140 --> 08:22.220
<i>Matsuyama slowly puts the ball down, and measures the distance.</i>

08:25.120 --> 08:26.190
All right!

08:34.940 --> 08:36.340
<i>Goal!</i>

08:36.340 --> 08:37.740
<i>Without giving the goalkeeper a chance to move,</i>

08:37.740 --> 08:40.240
<i>Furano catches up to Meiwa.</i>

08:40.240 --> 08:41.990
- You did it!
- All right!

08:42.860 --> 08:44.070
So you surrendered a goal, eh?

08:49.300 --> 08:51.840
We'll take the lead back immediately.

08:52.570 --> 08:58.010
<i>However, after the penalty kick, Kojiro was completely sealed off by Furano's pass work.</i>

08:59.390 --> 09:01.430
<i>The first half ends here.</i>

09:01.430 --> 09:04.100
<i>As the first half comes to a close, the score remains 1-1.</i>

09:04.100 --> 09:06.440
<i>Furano has fought this tooth and nail.</i>

09:06.830 --> 09:08.840
<i>They haven't given any ground to Meiwa,</i>

09:08.840 --> 09:10.440
<i>the favourite for the champion's title.</i>

09:10.830 --> 09:14.440
<i>No matter how you look at it, it's all thanks to Captain Matsuyama's efforts.</i>

09:14.960 --> 09:19.410
<i>After letting Hyuga score a goal right at the start of the game,</i>

09:19.410 --> 09:21.580
<i>they've managed to completely shut him down.</i>

09:22.220 --> 09:23.790
Is your leg okay?

09:23.790 --> 09:25.620
It's nothing to write home about.

09:25.620 --> 09:28.210
More importantly, let's keep this up in the second half, too.

09:28.210 --> 09:29.780
We can win, guys!

09:29.780 --> 09:30.880
Yes!

09:34.460 --> 09:38.220
<i>Hyuga looks off, today.</i>

09:40.220 --> 09:42.050
Damn it!

09:44.990 --> 09:46.850
Hyuga...

09:47.650 --> 09:50.860
<i>Kojiro, it can't be helped.</i>

09:50.860 --> 09:57.820
<i>You carried Meiwa all alone while working part-time jobs to help your family at the same time.</i>

09:58.340 --> 10:03.830
<i>Any average grade-schooler would be at their wits' end.</i>

10:05.210 --> 10:06.360
Takeshi...

10:06.360 --> 10:07.370
Yes.

10:08.060 --> 10:10.480
Listen to me. Just like in the match against Nankatsu,

10:10.480 --> 10:13.300
you'll be the key in this match, too.

10:13.300 --> 10:16.520
You are the only one who can help Hyuga now.

10:16.520 --> 10:17.920
Y-yes.

10:20.000 --> 10:21.290
<i>Hyuga...</i>

10:23.820 --> 10:26.640
<i>I met Hyuga last spring.</i>

10:27.870 --> 10:30.640
<i>I was still in 3rd grade then.</i>

10:30.640 --> 10:32.400
<i>One, two...</i>

10:32.400 --> 10:35.900
<i>Finally, Meiwa FC's entrance exam is tomorrow.</i>

10:35.900 --> 10:38.280
<i>I'll be sure to pass!</i>

10:39.790 --> 10:40.570
<i>My ball</i>

10:41.530 --> 10:45.620
<i>Hey you! If you're playing football half-heartedly, you'd better stop now.</i>

10:45.620 --> 10:46.620
<i>What...?</i>

10:46.620 --> 10:49.760
<i>When you stand on the pitch, everyone around you becomes your enemy,</i>

10:49.760 --> 10:52.880
<i>and those enemies will come at you from every direction.</i>

10:53.760 --> 10:58.010
<i>If you want to enroll at Meiwa FC, you'd better prepare yourself for that.</i>

10:59.290 --> 11:02.260
<i>I didn't know who he was back then...</i>

11:03.540 --> 11:06.690
<i>Please! Let me take the entrance exam!</i>

11:06.690 --> 11:10.810
<i>Again, the rules say that only 4th graders and above can take the test.</i>

11:10.810 --> 11:12.030
<i>I'm begging you!</i>

11:12.030 --> 11:13.190
<i>Just let me try!</i>

11:13.190 --> 11:14.920
<i>Just get out of here already!</i>

11:14.920 --> 11:17.190
<i>Let him try.</i>

11:17.890 --> 11:18.780
<i>Hyuga!</i>

11:18.780 --> 11:20.650
<i>You're the guy from before!</i>

11:21.070 --> 11:23.580
<i>Age is irrelevant in football.</i>

11:23.580 --> 11:25.620
<i>Football is all about displaying your own skills.</i>

11:25.620 --> 11:26.620
<i>What did you say?</i>

11:26.620 --> 11:30.930
<i>After all, I'm in 5th grade, and no one in the 6th grade can beat me, can they?</i>

11:31.460 --> 11:31.880
<i>What?!</i>

11:31.880 --> 11:32.900
<i>Here!</i>

11:32.900 --> 11:36.340
<i>Thanks to Hyuga, I was able to take the entrance exam.</i>

11:36.340 --> 11:39.890
<i>That little guy is pretty good, don't you think?</i>

11:39.890 --> 11:42.100
<i>And he's only a 3rd grader.</i>

11:42.100 --> 11:43.880
<i>Is that so?</i>

11:43.880 --> 11:47.040
<i>Coach Kira's personal training began after that.</i>

11:47.040 --> 11:48.500
<i>Not yet, Takeshi!</i>

11:48.500 --> 11:49.270
<i>Yes!</i>

11:49.270 --> 11:54.520
<i>When I learned that Hyuga was working to help his family while playing football,</i>

11:54.520 --> 11:59.280
<i>I really came to respect Hyuga more and more.</i>

11:59.280 --> 12:01.460
<i>Then I made a vow.</i>

12:01.460 --> 12:06.450
<i>I swore I'd get that championship pennant alongside Hyuga.</i>

12:07.790 --> 12:09.660
<i>The second half begins!</i>

12:09.660 --> 12:11.910
You have yet to see my true strength!

12:11.910 --> 12:14.170
I'll show it to you until you can't take it anymore!

12:14.170 --> 12:14.920
Take this!

12:15.360 --> 12:17.580
<i>Hyuga steals the ball.</i>

12:17.580 --> 12:19.750
<i>He launches forward and dribbles into enemy territory.</i>

12:19.750 --> 12:21.050
I'll take you on!

12:21.440 --> 12:23.670
<i>Matsuyama once again goes to stop Hyuga.</i>

12:23.670 --> 12:26.470
<i>It's another one-on-one fight between the two aces.</i>

12:26.470 --> 12:29.280
<i>Matsuyama gets away with the ball!</i>

12:29.280 --> 12:29.970
Damn it!

12:29.970 --> 12:30.930
What?!

12:30.930 --> 12:34.810
<i>The ball is quickly recovered by Meiwa's Sawada!</i>

12:34.810 --> 12:35.730
Takeshi!

12:37.000 --> 12:37.810
Hyuga!

12:38.780 --> 12:39.810
I won't let you get away!

12:39.810 --> 12:41.810
<i>Furano's defense is undermanned!</i>

12:42.360 --> 12:44.080
<i>Sawada crosses!</i>

12:44.080 --> 12:45.400
<i>It's a high ball!</i>

12:45.400 --> 12:47.200
<i>Can Matsuyama intercept it?</i>

12:48.950 --> 12:52.120
<i>It's no use! The ball flies in over his head!</i>

12:52.120 --> 12:54.340
Nice pass, Takeshi!

12:57.200 --> 12:58.420
<i>It's in!</i>

12:58.420 --> 13:00.630
<i>That's the second goal by Hyuga, today!</i>

13:01.080 --> 13:05.380
<i>With this goal, Hyuga is now the highest scorer of the tournament!</i>

13:05.380 --> 13:10.890
<i>Nankatsu's Tsubasa and Misaki's perfect combination play have become the talk of the tournament,</i>

13:10.890 --> 13:14.520
<i>but Meiwa's Hyuga and Sawada's combination play can hold its ground, too.</i>

13:14.520 --> 13:18.980
<i>When these two team up, Meiwa gets stronger!</i>

13:19.850 --> 13:26.480
<i>That's right. I'll help Hyuga throughout this tournament, and we'll be the champions in the end!</i>

13:34.520 --> 13:38.230
<i>The first match of the National Youth Football Tournament semi-finals,</i>

13:38.230 --> 13:41.000
<i>Meiwa vs. Furano, is close to its conclusion!</i>

13:41.000 --> 13:45.130
<i>There are 5 minutes left and Meiwa is hanging on to a 2-1 lead.</i>

13:45.130 --> 13:47.620
<i>Furano has managed to occasionally to threaten the goal,</i>

13:47.620 --> 13:49.640
<i>but Meiwa have been enduring it so far.</i>

13:50.160 --> 13:54.640
<i>Meiwa and Furano have played dozens of games until now.</i>

13:54.640 --> 13:57.140
<i>Exhaustion must be catching up with them.</i>

13:57.140 --> 13:58.630
<i>But still, they are doing their best!</i>

13:58.630 --> 14:01.150
<i>Both sides continue to endure despite it all!</i>

14:01.150 --> 14:02.670
Do your best, Furano!

14:02.670 --> 14:03.900
Just one more push!

14:03.900 --> 14:07.150
<i>Like I'd fall to a bunch of losers like you</i>

14:07.150 --> 14:11.510
<i>Hyuga's definitely off today.</i>

14:11.510 --> 14:14.660
<i>Matsuyama is also running around with a hurt leg, due to Hyuga's tackle.</i>

14:14.660 --> 14:17.910
<i>We still can't be sure who will come out on top!</i>

14:19.480 --> 14:21.920
<i>Like I'd let such a small injury stop me!</i>

14:21.920 --> 14:23.170
Captain!

14:23.170 --> 14:25.920
<i>A direct pass to Matsuyama!</i>

14:25.920 --> 14:28.800
Destroy him! Don't let him past!

14:29.920 --> 14:31.430
<i>A quick one-two pass!</i>

14:31.430 --> 14:33.300
<i>Will Furano be able to continue like this?</i>

14:33.300 --> 14:34.810
I won't let that happen!

14:35.410 --> 14:38.480
<i>Matsuyama got tackled!</i>

14:38.480 --> 14:39.230
Crap!

14:41.660 --> 14:43.520
<i>That's a foul play for Meiwa.</i>

14:43.520 --> 14:45.490
<i>Ishii receives a yellow-card.</i>

14:45.490 --> 14:47.150
<i>Furano will prepare for a free kick, here.</i>

14:47.150 --> 14:48.150
Captain!

14:49.790 --> 14:51.240
Damn it!

14:51.240 --> 14:53.870
As if I'd lose because of such a thing!

14:54.260 --> 14:55.410
Captain...

14:55.410 --> 14:59.160
When it comes to training ourselves, there's no one we'd lose to!

14:59.810 --> 15:04.620
When you compare this with our time training in the cold snow,

15:04.620 --> 15:07.170
you can hardly think of this as a hardship!

15:08.010 --> 15:10.370
Guys, I am sure it's tough for you all.

15:10.370 --> 15:11.920
But all we need is one more push!

15:11.920 --> 15:14.640
Let's show them the result of our training!

15:14.640 --> 15:15.850
Yeah!

15:17.020 --> 15:19.500
<i>They are setting up for a free kick at the spot.</i>

15:19.500 --> 15:21.850
<i>Furano is presented with a chance to tie.</i>

15:21.850 --> 15:23.060
<i>Damn!</i>

15:23.060 --> 15:24.940
<i>That's a dangerous spot for a free kick.</i>

15:26.460 --> 15:27.610
Hyuga?!

15:28.790 --> 15:30.530
You're feverish...

15:30.530 --> 15:32.490
It's fine, Takeshi.

15:32.490 --> 15:34.280
<i>There are three forwards up front.</i>

15:34.280 --> 15:37.160
<i>Where will Matsuyama send the ball to?</i>

15:37.990 --> 15:39.080
<i>I'm counting on you!</i>

15:40.870 --> 15:42.120
<i>To the far post!</i>

15:42.120 --> 15:43.580
They go up for a mid-air battle!

15:43.580 --> 15:46.920
<i>When you compare this to our jumping in the snow...</i>

15:46.920 --> 15:47.760
Take it!

15:47.760 --> 15:48.420
Wha—

15:48.420 --> 15:50.280
<i>The ball is sent towards the right!</i>

15:50.280 --> 15:51.630
<i>Damn, I need to cover!</i>

15:52.250 --> 15:54.640
<i>Again, the ball is sent to the right!</i>

15:54.640 --> 15:56.720
<i>Finally, Oda takes the shot!</i>

15:57.540 --> 15:59.100
<i>Will it be a tie?!</i>

15:59.100 --> 16:01.220
<i>It isn't!</i>

16:02.100 --> 16:04.060
<i>Hyuga manages to block it! What a close call!</i>

16:04.060 --> 16:07.270
<i>But, the ball's deflected towards Matsuyama!</i>

16:07.980 --> 16:08.860
<i>Damn!</i>

16:08.860 --> 16:10.360
I won't let you shoot!

16:10.360 --> 16:12.860
<i>Sawada is trying to stop the shot with a slide!</i>

16:12.860 --> 16:15.820
<i>Who will be faster, Matsuyama or Sawada?</i>

16:18.010 --> 16:19.840
<i>Matsuyama wins the battle!</i>

16:19.840 --> 16:21.330
<i>Furano ties the score!</i>

16:21.330 --> 16:23.740
- You did it, Captain!
- Nice shot!

16:23.740 --> 16:26.830
<i>Furano have used their team work to equalize the score!</i>

16:26.830 --> 16:28.750
It was awesome!

16:33.510 --> 16:34.670
Let's go!

16:34.670 --> 16:37.390
<i>Furano gathers their strength and presses on!</i>

16:38.420 --> 16:39.930
Damn!

16:39.930 --> 16:42.930
I won't lose to the likes of you!

16:42.930 --> 16:45.600
<i>Hyuga comes with a sliding tackle.</i>

16:46.160 --> 16:47.540
<i>It's dodged!</i>

16:47.540 --> 16:48.110
What!?

16:49.240 --> 16:50.780
<i>The ball is sent in front of the goal!</i>

16:50.780 --> 16:51.980
How do you like that?

16:51.980 --> 16:54.490
<i>Oda runs up to the area!</i>

16:54.490 --> 16:56.740
<i>Stop him! Whatever you do, don't let him shoot!</i>

16:59.920 --> 17:01.580
<i>It's a hand ball!</i>

17:01.580 --> 17:04.540
<i>Meiwa commits a foul in the penalty area!</i>

17:05.850 --> 17:07.790
<i>Furano wins a penalty kick!</i>

17:09.740 --> 17:11.680
A penalty kick...

17:11.680 --> 17:13.550
<i>What a shocking turn of events!</i>

17:13.550 --> 17:17.050
<i>There is less than a minute left to go in this match.</i>

17:17.540 --> 17:21.310
<i>Furano has a chance to punch their ticket to the finals!</i>

17:21.820 --> 17:27.100
<i>Me... lose in such a place?</i>

17:28.570 --> 17:30.190
<i>Hyuga...</i>

17:30.650 --> 17:32.150
<i>Walking up to take the kick is the Captain,</i>

17:32.150 --> 17:36.450
<i>Hikaru Matsuyama, who scored their previous penalty in the first half.</i>

17:36.450 --> 17:38.450
Captain, we're counting on you.

17:38.450 --> 17:39.200
Okay!

17:39.200 --> 17:43.310
But remember: we all worked together to make this possible!

17:43.310 --> 17:47.230
So I'll make sure to put all of your feelings into this penalty kick!

17:47.230 --> 17:48.210
Yes!

17:50.870 --> 17:52.000
All right.

18:05.560 --> 18:06.310
Hold on!

18:08.330 --> 18:10.440
There will be a keeper change.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.730
Wakashimazu...?!

18:12.730 --> 18:13.820
So, you have come!

18:13.820 --> 18:14.980
Wakashimazu!

18:14.980 --> 18:17.190
They are changing their goalkeeper?

18:17.740 --> 18:21.670
<i>He is an invincible goalkeeper I brought up, Ken Wakashimazu.</i>

18:21.670 --> 18:26.480
<i>He's returned from a traffic accident from several months ago. He rises once more, like a phoenix!</i>

18:25.160 --> 18:27.320
We're counting on you, Wakashimazu!

18:34.300 --> 18:36.090
Wakashimazu.

18:36.090 --> 18:39.510
Captain, once I catch this, I'll pass it to you.

18:46.170 --> 18:49.060
<i>Wakashimazu gets into position.</i>

18:50.560 --> 18:54.320
<i>No matter who the keeper is, I'll definitely score this!</i>

18:59.650 --> 19:02.410
<i>This is the penalty kick everyone worked so hard to earn!</i>

19:02.410 --> 19:06.040
<i>I don't care if my leg breaks—I'll score! No matter what!</i>

19:07.060 --> 19:10.040
<i>Matsuyama fires away with no hesitation!</i>

19:13.920 --> 19:15.530
<i>It's caught!</i>

19:15.530 --> 19:18.010
<i>Wakashimazu firmly hangs on to the ball!</i>

19:18.390 --> 19:19.880
Let's go, Captain!

19:22.240 --> 19:25.050
<i>Wakashimazu sends the ball flying to Hyuga without a moment's delay!</i>

19:25.050 --> 19:27.060
Crap! Go after Hyuga!

19:27.060 --> 19:30.810
<i>Hyuga collects himself and makes a mad dash towards Furano's goal!</i>

19:30.810 --> 19:35.140
<i>Furano is chasing him with all of their might!</i>

19:35.140 --> 19:37.570
<i>This is the final battle between Meiwa and Furano!</i>

19:37.570 --> 19:42.240
<i>Hyuga makes it into Furano's side of the field and continues his run!</i>

19:43.770 --> 19:44.740
My leg...

19:45.160 --> 19:47.160
<i>I'm counting on you guys...!</i>

19:50.340 --> 19:53.460
<i>Goal... I have to send it into the goal.</i>

19:53.460 --> 19:55.920
Damn, we have to catch up with him!

19:58.860 --> 20:01.300
<i>Goal... I'm going to shoot.</i>

20:03.710 --> 20:07.970
<i>The ball gets stuck between Hyuga's foot and the Furano players' tackle in a furious clash!</i>

20:09.940 --> 20:10.470
What!?

20:11.230 --> 20:13.230
sound of ball breaking the sound wall

20:15.950 --> 20:17.400
<i>He's blown them away!</i>

20:18.920 --> 20:21.740
<i>The final whistle blows, signaling the end of the match!</i>

20:22.740 --> 20:25.990
<i>What a dramatic end to the match!</i>

20:25.990 --> 20:27.650
<i>The score is 3-2.</i>

20:27.650 --> 20:31.130
<i>The curtain finally closes on this fierce cat-and-mouse game!</i>

20:31.130 --> 20:34.000
<i>Meiwa manages to overcome Furano despite much difficulty!</i>

20:34.730 --> 20:36.500
<i>That's our captain for you.</i>

20:38.960 --> 20:41.620
Furano has lost.

20:41.620 --> 20:42.840
Guys...

20:42.840 --> 20:44.020
Won...

20:44.020 --> 20:45.420
Hyuga!

20:45.420 --> 20:47.930
Did I win...?

20:48.430 --> 20:49.850
- Hyuga!
- Captain!?

20:49.850 --> 20:51.140
Kojiro!

20:51.140 --> 20:53.100
The doctor, call for the doctor!

20:53.710 --> 20:56.730
<i>As I thought, Hyuga's condition today was...</i>

20:57.340 --> 20:59.320
Let's go.

20:59.740 --> 21:01.320
Don't cry, you guys.

21:01.320 --> 21:06.320
We tried our hardest, we fought with all we had and we came this far.

21:06.320 --> 21:08.820
We can return to Hokkaido with our heads held high.

21:08.820 --> 21:10.820
Y-yeah.

21:12.730 --> 21:13.960
Hyuga...

21:15.210 --> 21:16.600
I'm fine.

21:17.960 --> 21:21.070
I'm just a little dizzy.

21:21.070 --> 21:22.210
<i>Hyuga...</i>

21:22.210 --> 21:25.320
<i>I said all sorts of things about you,</i>

21:25.320 --> 21:28.840
<i>but you fought with everything you had in your own way.</i>

21:28.840 --> 21:31.850
<i>I understood that after playing against you today.</i>

21:32.900 --> 21:36.140
<i>Today, we lost.</i>

21:36.140 --> 21:42.180
<i>But let's play again someday, Kojiro Hyuga!</i>

21:45.660 --> 21:47.680
That was a great match.

21:47.680 --> 21:48.360
Yes.

21:48.360 --> 21:51.370
All right, it's our turn now.

21:51.370 --> 21:55.470
Let's show the crowd a match as great as theirs!

21:55.470 --> 21:56.370
Okay!

22:03.360 --> 22:07.590
<i>It's almost time for our showdown, Tsubasa!</i>

22:07.590 --> 22:13.560
<i>Misugi, no matter what happens, I'll fight you with everything I've got.</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.790 --> 22:44.670
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.670 --> 22:50.680
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.680
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:56.680
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.680 --> 23:02.150
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.680 --> 23:02.150
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.110 --> 23:08.280
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:14.990
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.200 --> 23:14.990
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:14.990 --> 23:21.040
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.040 --> 23:26.050
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.340 --> 23:33.220
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.220 --> 23:39.100
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.980
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.100 --> 23:45.980
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.070 --> 24:00.640
COMING UP, EPISODE 20:
MUSASHI'S SECRET PLAN
